  "question": {
    "text": "If \\(\\mathrm{g}\\) is the acceleration due to gravity on the surface of the earth, the gain in potential energy of an object of mass \\(\\mathrm{m}\\) raised from the earth's surface to a height equal to the radius \\(R\\) of the earth is",
